    "additionalInfo": "Please note that the admission ticket to the castle will be booked by the guide upon arrival at the location.\r\n\r\nChildren aged 1–10 years can join for free if they are accompanied by an adult, who is 21 years and above.\r\n\r\nPlease note that some venues may be closed during winters. Please contact the tour provider for more information.\r\n\r\nPlease note that jousting happens on limited days.\r\n\r\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\r\n\r\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\r\n\r\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ",
