    "description": "Through this tour, you'll have the chance to visit Arundel Castle, a remodelled castle in West Sussex, originally built in the 11th century. Your tour will begin with a two-hour drive from Bromley, taking you along the serene English countryside.\r\n\r\nUpon reaching the castle, you'll get to wander around its sprawling grounds, walking in the footsteps of kings, queens and knights. You can also browse through the various artwork and artefacts, and visit the Fitzalan Chapel towards the west of the castle grounds.",
